          "language": "go",
          "text": "package upload\n\nimport \"time\"\n\n// Retry calls f until it succeeds or attempts run out.\nfunc Retry(attempts int, f func() error) error {\n\tvar err error\n\tfor i := 0; i < attempts; i++ {\n\t\tif err = f(); err == nil {\n\t\t\treturn nil\n\t\t}\n\t\ttime.Sleep(time.Duration(1<<i) * time.Second)\n\t}\n\treturn err\n}\n",
